Sol. $\lim _{x \rightarrow 7} \frac{18-[1-x]}{[x]-3 a}$
L.H.L. $\lim _{x \rightarrow 7-} \frac{18-[1-x]}{[x]-3 a}$
$$\begin{array}{l}
=\frac{18-(-6)}{6-3 a} \\
=\frac{24}{6-3 a}
\end{array}$$
R.H.L. $\lim _{x \rightarrow 7+} \frac{18-[1-x]}{[x]-3 a}$
$$\begin{array}{l}
=\frac{18-(-7)}{7-3 a} \\
=\frac{25}{7-3 a}
\end{array}$$

